// SAM Registry Hive Handle Request | T1012, T1552.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/security/win_security_sam_registry_hive_handle_request.yml
any where winlog.channel:"Security" and (event.code:"4656" and winlog.event_data.ObjectType:"Key" and winlog.event_data.ObjectName:"*\\SAM")
